Loop-2 integration deltas on top of 0009, per the SUM brief:
(a) LinearRegionFile is final-content in 0009 (implements AbstractRegionFile,
    explicit clear(), @Override marks) — no hunk here.
(b) B2 guard kept verbatim (0009); here: linearCrashOnBrokenSymlink field +
    6-arg ctor chain (storage/IOWorker/Simple/Entity/ChunkMap/PoiManager) +
    the two guard call sites (existingOnly probe, write-path create).
    Kaiiju-bug grep: no `|| !endsWith`, no executable `format.equals(`,
    no `(linear | mca)` outside comments.
(c) Deps: zstd-jni 1.5.6-8 in folia-server/build.gradle.kts (+ tracked
    build.gradle.kts.patch hunk); lz4 NOT pinned (vanilla/mache supplies
    net.jpountz.lz4; at.yawk 1.10.1 same package, single copy).
(d) A7 config (paper-patches 0008): call sites read the EXACT A7 API
    level.paperConfig().regionFormat.{format,linear.compressionLevel,
    linear.crashOnBrokenSymlink}, mapped A7 enum -> net.sexidium enum.

